{"id":"614054","name":"番茄虾尾意面","author":"°ZWH","authorId":"11170916","desc":"","cover":"images/614054/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"意面","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"香菇","amount":"适量"},{"name":"番茄","amount":"适量"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"西兰花","amount":"适量"},{"name":"虾尾","amount":"适量"},{"name":"墨鱼丸","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"备料图：香菇切片、番茄去皮切块、洋葱切丝、西兰花煮熟、虾尾去皮、墨鱼丸切片。","img":"images/614054/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"水开后煮意面十分钟。","img":"images/614054/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"热油锅小火炒软番茄块。","img":"images/614054/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加香菇略炒。","img":"images/614054/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"盛出备用。","img":"images/614054/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"炒香洋葱丝。","img":"images/614054/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加墨鱼丸、虾尾翻炒。","img":"images/614054/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒入炒好的番茄香菇，炒匀。","img":"images/614054/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"意面煮十分钟后，关火焖五分钟。","img":"images/614054/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"准备酱汁：2勺生抽。","img":"images/614054/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"勺蚝油。","img":"images/614054/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"勺番茄酱。","img":"images/614054/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"半勺白糖。","img":"images/614054/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"适量盐。","img":"images/614054/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"搅匀。","img":"images/614054/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"煮好的意面倒入炒好的配菜里。","img":"images/614054/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"加酱汁，翻拌均匀。","img":"images/614054/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"盛出，摆盘，放西兰花。","img":"images/614054/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/614054/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}